  `convention.how-to-kumbuka.*` seeden?
- Server-Feld `user_account.onboarding` → `server`-Sub-Sprint.
- Operator merged: PR #52 (Wizard), PR #57 (dogfood-11), console-Feature-Branch.
- Projektspezifische Scope-Pin-Variante (literaler Slug) — eigenes Design, später.
