- Memory: `decision.adr-0018` (forget+remember → de-ratified) · `open-question.ee-composition-root` (neu)
- `spec/docs/adr/0018-…md` + `INDEX-adr.md` (de-ratified, adoptiert)

## Deferred (Trigger)
